{"id":"indu_stria","lemma":"indústria","pos":"noun","rank":2244,"glosses":["industry","mill, factory"],"ipa":"/ĩˈdus.tɾjɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"indústrias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Ed_Guimaraes-ind%C3%BAstria.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ele trabalha na indústria automobilística.","en":"He works in the car industry.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabalhar"},{"g":"in the"},null,null]},{"text":"A indústria do carvão está morrendo.","en":"The coal industry is dying.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"coal"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to die","l":"morrer"}]},{"text":"O governo está tentando desenvolver novas indústrias.","en":"The government is trying to develop new industries.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"government"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to try","l":"tentar"},{"g":"to develop"},{"g":"recently made or created","l":"novo"},null]},{"text":"O governo deveria investir mais dinheiro na indústria.","en":"The government should invest more money in industry.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"government"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to invest"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"A indústria estava crescendo rapidamente.","en":"Industry was growing quickly.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to grow","l":"crescer"},{"g":"rapidly, quickly"}]}]}